__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.env
.DS_Store
# working clones are regenerated; never committed
data/clones/
results/*.local.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable API caches. Excluded to keep a judge's clone small.
#
# KEPT (small, and the credential-free checks read them):
#   data/fixtures/          the 15-artifact labelled corpus - the headline result
#   data/cache/github/content-*, readme-*, repo-*   pinning + portability
#   data/cache/zenodo/, data/cache/links/           tiny
#   results/, dataset/                              every reported number
#
# DROPPED (regenerable; `make prevalence` / `make corpus` refetch them):
data/cache/github/tree-*
data/cache/github/head-*
data/cache/github/issues-*
data/cache/prevalence/
data/cache/discover/
data/negative_control/

# Local agent/editor tooling. Machine-specific by nature - launch.json holds
# absolute paths, which is precisely the defect portability.py detects, and it
# failed this project's own CI gate three times before being removed.
.claude/
